  blurb:"Story County's water trail — 33 miles with 11 access points running from Story City through Ames. A \"non-meandered\" stream under Iowa law: the state owns the water, not always the banks. It is the Iowa DNR's Skunk River Water Trail: 33.8 designated miles in Story County, designated in June 2020 (per Iowa DNR, 2026-10).",
