  osmName:"Missouri River",
  parkRegsSrc:"montana",
  parkRegs:"<b>Holter Dam to Black Eagle Dam</b><br>• Combined trout: 3 daily and in possession, only 1 over 18 inches, and only 1 may be a brown trout.<br>• Walleye: 10 daily and 20 in possession.<br>• Northern pike: no limit.<br><br><b>Central District standard rules</b> — rivers and streams open all year. Combined trout (brown, rainbow, golden and cutthroat trout and arctic grayling): 3 daily and in possession, only 1 over 18 inches, only 1 can be a cutthroat trout; all arctic grayling must be released immediately. Brook trout: 20 daily and in possession.",
