  parkRegs:"<i>Part of this river is a Gear Restricted Stream; its entry is in the booklet's Gear Restricted Streams list (pp. 44–46).</i><br><br><b>Type 1 trout stream</b> — Fishing season: Last Sat. in April – Sep. 30. Possession season: Last Sat. in April – Sep. 30. Minimum size: Brook Trout 7\"; Brown Trout 8\"; Atlantic, Chinook, Coho &amp; Pink Salmon, Lake Trout, Rainbow Trout (Steelhead) &amp; Splake 10\". All trout and salmon daily possession limit: 5 fish, but no more than 3 trout 15\" or greater.<br><br><i>Reach boundaries and each reach's Type are on the DNR's Inland Trout &amp; Salmon maps (Michigan.gov/FishingMaps) and in the county listing, pp. 48–65 — which reach you're on decides which row applies.</i>",
