  parkRegsSrc:"wisouthshore",
  parkRegs:"<i>This stream's reaches carry 3 different regulations; which one applies depends on where you stand — check the WDNR trout regulations map for the reach.</i><br><br><b>3 Trout in Total Over 8 inches</b><br>• Season: First Saturday in April at 5:00 a.m. to Oct. 15.<br>• Early season: First Saturday in January to First Saturday in April all trout shall be immediately released. Only artificial lures may be used.<br>• Bag: 3 trout in total over 8\".<br><br><b>Length, Bag and Possession Limits Vary by Water</b><br>• Season: First Saturday in April at 5:00 a.m. to Oct. 15.<br>• Early season: First Saturday in January to First Saturday in April all trout shall be immediately released. Only artificial lures may be used.<br>• Bag: 1 trout over 18\".<br><br><b>Great Lake Tributary</b><br>• Season: Last Saturday in March to Nov. 15.<br>• Bag: 5 trout and salmon in total, only 2 of which may be brown trout over 15\" and only 1 of which may be a rainbow trout, all brook trout caught shall be immediately released; minimum length limit: brown trout 10\" salmon 12\" and rainbow trout 26\".",
  goodFlow:null, // TODO: set {min:___,max:___} (CFS) for YOUR good-flow range on this river
