  parkRegs:"<b>Unlimited trout; unlimited striped bass; unlimited catfish.</b> A valid <b>Arizona fishing or combination licence</b> is required for resident and nonresident anglers ten years of age or older. No live baitfish may be used or in possession on any waters in Coconino County. Humpback chub, razorback sucker, bluehead sucker, flannelmouth sucker and speckled dace are protected statewide and may not be angled for, taken or possessed.<br><br><b>Bright Angel Creek</b> — Unlimited trout; unlimited striped bass; unlimited catfish. Trout taken at Bright Angel Creek shall be killed and retained as part of the bag limit or immediately released.<br><br><b>Arizona statewide daily bag</b> — trout (includes rainbow, cutthroat, brown, brook, tiger, Gila and Apache trout; grayling): 4, any combination. The possession limit is two times the daily bag limit.<br><i>— AZGFD 2025 &amp; 2026 Fishing Regulations, Special Regulations and Seasons – Fish: Commission Order 40</i>",
