  fish:"Fine-spotted cutthroat. The braided lower end shifts channels from year to year, so what was a good run last August may be dry gravel this one. WGFD stream class: <b>Green Ribbon</b> — 1–49 lb of trout per mile. Game fish present, per WGFD: Brook Trout, Mountain Whitefish, Snake River Cutthroat. The line follows WGFD's map of the creek past the park boundary: about 19.7 km of it is outside the park, under Wyoming's Area 1 rules.",
