  blurb:"2.0 miles in Rockingham County, drawn from Virginia DWR's trout stream maps: 2.0 designated stocked trout water. 2026 stocking plan: Category C. Regulations from the 2026 Freshwater Fishing &amp; Boating in Virginia.",
