  blurb:"35.9 miles in Botetourt County, drawn from OpenStreetMap. DWR: “From the confluence of the Jackson and Cowpasture rivers in Alleghany Co., the James flows east toward Richmond.” (p. 53) Regulations from the 2026 Freshwater Fishing &amp; Boating in Virginia.",
