  blurb:"1.5 miles in Scott County, drawn from Virginia DWR's trout stream maps: 1.5 under special regulations (Delayed Harvest Waters). 2026 stocking plan: DH. Regulations from the 2026 Freshwater Fishing &amp; Boating in Virginia.",
