  blurb:"3.4 miles in Buchanan County and Dickenson County, drawn from Virginia DWR's trout stream maps: 3.4 designated stocked trout water. 2026 stocking plan: Category C, Category B. Regulations from the 2026 Freshwater Fishing &amp; Boating in Virginia.",
