  blurb:"MDC manages the Meramec River as trout water: a Red Ribbon Trout Area (from Highway 8 bridge to Scott’s Ford and in Dry Fork Creek from the elevated cable crossing to its confluence with the Meramec River, 8.2 miles, Phelps and Crawford counties) (2026 Summary, pp. 26–27).",
  fish:"brown trout, stocked (Red Ribbon areas “are stocked primarily with browns”, p. 26)",
