  blurb:"MDC manages Roubidoux Creek as trout water: a White Ribbon Trout Area (downstream from Roubidoux Spring, 3.1 miles, Pulaski County) (2026 Summary, pp. 26–27). MDC’s White Ribbon streams “receive periodic stockings of rainbow trout, and some also receive brown trout” (p. 26).",
