  fish:"Henrys Lake is managed as a trophy water, which is why the trout limit is two and fishing stops once you've kept them.",
  regs:"<b>Henrys Lake — Section: those portions of the lake within the posted boundaries of Staley Springs and within 100 yards of Hatchery Creek</b><br>• Closed to fishing<br><b>Remainder of Henrys Lake</b><br>• February 15 through Friday before Memorial Day Weekend – trout – catch-and-release, including Brook Trout.<br>• Saturday of Memorial Day Weekend through February 14 – trout limit is 2, Brook Trout counted in the trout limit<br>• Fishing must cease after the 2-trout daily bag limit has been reduced to possession<br><i>— IDFG 2025–2027 Fishing Seasons &amp; Rules, 2nd edition, Upper Snake Region special rule waters, p. 43</i>",
